    "ruleNumber": "09.07.01",
    "summary": "A stratagem or ability that forces a Desperate Escape test calls for separate Hazard rolls for the unit’s models and a single Battle-shock roll for the unit. The unit must use Desperate Escape when selected to Fall Back. References to the test, including its penalties and rerolls, operate on the mode’s Hazard rolls.",
